  "notes": [
    "Color naming: only #005BC8 (home.sophos.com/Science Blue) and #696A6B (home.sophos.com/Nevada) have descriptive names in the colorNames evidence. All other local paint styles are named after their hex value (e.g. '#FF8000'). Those labels keep the exact style name, and the ids are descriptive fallbacks (cyan, orange, gray-100, and so on). #D8EFFC is a documented swatch (74:3389) with no paint style.",
    "blue-hover (#006AD1) and orange-hover (#FFA50D) are not board swatches. They were measured from the hover specimens of the primary (73:3259) and purchase (73:3261) buttons and added so the hover states can use palette properties.",
    "Typography: the ids are the leaf of each 'Web/<name>' style name, normalized (Web/Title 1 -> title-1), and the labels keep the exact Figma style names. Line heights come from FONT_SIZE_% values and are kept as percent. Letter spacing is pixel value / font size in em. Feature flags are taken from the specimens: Lexend Exa styles use ss01 on and liga off, and Inter styles use ss04 on.",
    "Elements: h1-h6 map to Title 1-6, following the board's numbered title hierarchy. p is null because three body styles exist (Large, Medium and Small) and no default is specified.",
    "Button families: secondary (white pill, 25/8 padding, Web/Button 16px, hover fill #F0F9FE), primary (Science Blue pill, 30/10 padding, 13px Button Small metrics, hover fill #006AD1), purchase (orange pill, 30/10 padding, Web/Button 16px, hover fill #FFA50D), outline (transparent pill with a 1px Science Blue border, 30/10 padding, 16px; the documented hover 77:3455 is identical to the default) and link (cta_text: Web/Button Link 14px text plus a 16x16.5 circled-chevron icon with a 10px gap; on hover the text and icon turn black). Primary and purchase are separate families because their font size and height differ (13px/33px vs 16px/36px), not only their color. All pills use radius 30. The fixed 140px width of the primary specimen comes from the sample text and was not encoded.",
    "The purchase specimen label overrides part of the text with a strikethrough ('$59.99'). This is sample price content and is not encoded as a button style. The secondary label fill was measured as #015BC8 and is mapped to science-blue #005BC8.",
    "Text-only buttons use gap 0 because the specimens have no icon child (Figma itemSpacing is 10). The link button's default and hover icons are separate assets because the stroke and glyph color change from #005BC8 to #000000. The blue circled-chevron in the link (73:3253) has the same glyph and paint as the icon-row specimen 73:3295, so that export is reused.",
    "Radii, breakpoints and container use the supplied defaults; the observed radii are 5 for swatches, 8 for the icon circle and 30 for button pills. Spacing was copied from spacingEvidence (default e25 scale; no Figma variables were available). No mobile sizes are documented.",
    "Excluded: the gray board background, the presentation-only Inter labels, the Lexend CSS-annotation text and the decorative separator lines. The eight25 credit (73:2989, an image fill) is included only as brand artwork. 73:3299 is a white chevron-down (same shape as 73:3301) that is invisible on the white icon row.",
    "The host exports each item in labeled icon/logo rows, including unnamed vectors. Button paints are read from the mapped Figma states; empty fills stay transparent.",
    "Styles use the selected breakpoint system. Generate the E25 padded Container separately after applying the style guide. Google families use next/font/google; custom families use the attached files.",
    "Figma variables could not be read. Using the default 30-token spacing scale and its spacing safelist."
  ],
